{
  "$defs": {
    "FeatureObservation": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "交给 Provider 的一条输入观察：一个 PIT 选中的 Canonical revision（或其确定性派生）。\n\n- `observation_key`：业务观察的稳定键；`event_time` / `event_end_time`：事件时刻或半开区间\n  `[event_time, event_end_time)`（区间型数据，例如 bar）；\n- `available_time`（历史轴）不早于观察本身可被观察的时刻（区间取结束端）；`knowledge_time`\n  （知识轴）由请求的 `knowledge_cutoff` 约束；\n- `values`：市场内容，键为小写标识符，值为 `Decimal | int | bool | str`（数值规则见模块文档）；\n- `lineage`：Canonical revision → Raw row → Raw source 的来源链。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.6.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "observation_key": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Observation Key",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "event_time": {
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Event Time",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "event_end_time": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "format": "date-time",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Event End Time"
        },
        "available_time": {
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Available Time",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "knowledge_time": {
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Knowledge Time",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "values": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "patternProperties": {
            "^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "pattern": "^(?!^[-+.]*$)[+-]?0*\\d*\\.?\\d*$",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                {
                  "type": "boolean"
                },
                {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "title": "Values",
          "type": "object"
        },
        "lineage": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/SelectedRevisionLineage"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "observation_key",
        "event_time",
        "available_time",
        "knowledge_time",
        "values",
        "lineage"
      ],
      "title": "FeatureObservation",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "Kind": {
      "description": "可版本化对象的类型（02-domain.md §1）。",
      "enum": [
        "dataset",
        "representation",
        "feature",
        "state",
        "event",
        "outcome",
        "strategy",
        "risk",
        "cost_model",
        "experiment",
        "hypothesis",
        "knowledge",
        "artifact",
        "profile",
        "profile_selection_rule"
      ],
      "title": "Kind",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "Ref": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "对象引用：`{kind}:{name}@{version}`。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.6.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "kind": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/Kind"
        },
        "name": {
          "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$",
          "title": "Name",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "version": {
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Version",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "kind",
        "name",
        "version"
      ],
      "title": "Ref",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "SelectedRevisionLineage": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "一个选中 Canonical revision 的来源链：Canonical revision → Raw row revision → Raw source\npayload revision。\n\n第三跳是通用的来源 hop：首切片归档路径中 source 即归档文件 revision\n（`raw.binance_spot_archives`）；D3 REST 补尾的 Raw 响应载荷同样用这一跳表达（ADR-0022）。\n契约只表达 hop 的形状，具体 source 类型与其内容由未来 Collector / 表实现证明。\n\n表名为 Iceberg `namespace.table`：`canonical_table` 必须在 `canonical` namespace，`raw_table` 与\n`source_table` 必须在 `raw` namespace（03-data.md §7.1）。稳定身份为\n`(canonical_table, canonical_revision_id)`。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.6.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "canonical_table": {
          "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$",
          "title": "Canonical Table",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "canonical_revision_id": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Canonical Revision Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "raw_table": {
          "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$",
          "title": "Raw Table",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "raw_revision_id": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Raw Revision Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "source_table": {
          "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$",
          "title": "Source Table",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "source_revision_id": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Source Revision Id",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "canonical_table",
        "canonical_revision_id",
        "raw_table",
        "raw_revision_id",
        "source_table",
        "source_revision_id"
      ],
      "title": "SelectedRevisionLineage",
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "一次特征计算请求。\n\n- `feature` 必须是 `kind=feature` 的引用，`spec_hash` 为该 `FeatureSpec` 的内容哈希；\n- `manifest_content_hash`：输入所属 Research Dataset manifest 的内容哈希；\n- `evaluation_times`：非空、严格升序（因而唯一）；\n- `observations`：按 `(available_time, observation_key)` 规范排序；该二元组重复即拒绝（否则规范\n  顺序与可见集合都不唯一）；每条观察 `knowledge_time <= knowledge_cutoff`，否则构造即拒绝。\n\n同一请求内容 → 同一 `content_hash()`（输入顺序不影响）。",
  "properties": {
    "schema_version": {
      "default": "2.6.0",
      "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
      "title": "Schema Version",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "feature": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/Ref"
    },
    "spec_hash": {
      "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
      "title": "Spec Hash",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "manifest_content_hash": {
      "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
      "title": "Manifest Content Hash",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "knowledge_cutoff": {
      "format": "date-time",
      "title": "Knowledge Cutoff",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "evaluation_times": {
      "items": {
        "format": "date-time",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "minItems": 1,
      "title": "Evaluation Times",
      "type": "array",
      "uniqueItems": true
    },
    "observations": {
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/FeatureObservation"
      },
      "title": "Observations",
      "type": "array"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "feature",
    "spec_hash",
    "manifest_content_hash",
    "knowledge_cutoff",
    "evaluation_times",
    "observations"
  ],
  "title": "FeatureRequest",
  "type": "object"
}
